===Etymology 2===
Found in {{lang|zh|《字彙補》}}: {{zh-x|㘛，蠻 曲 名。《@唐書》@韋皋 進 蠻 中 樂曲 十一：@㘛聰綱摩。從 堪 音。|{{lang|zh|㘛}} is [used in] a name of a barbarian song. According to the {{lang|zh|《唐書》}}, when [[w:Wei Gao|Wei Gao]] went to the barbarians, it was the 11th song [on the ceremony]: {{lang|zh|㘛聰綱摩}}. It sounds like {{zh-l|堪*}}.|CL|collapsed=y}}

But the cited work, {{lang|zh|《唐書》}}, has it as {{lang|zh|𭍌}}: {{zh-x|十一 曰 宴樂，驃 云 @𭍌聰網摩，謂 時康 宴會 嘉 也。|The 11th song is "The feast music", and in Pyu language it is called {{lang|zh|𭍌聰網摩}}, which means "Celebrating the feast in prosperous times".|CL|collapsed=y}}

The word {{lang|zh|𭍌聰網摩}} appears to be a transcription from the [[w:Pyu language (Sino-Tibetan)|Pyu language]].

